<title>THAILAND: Thailand to license property mutual funds.</title>
<headline>Thailand to license property mutual funds.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Securities and Exchange of Thailand said on Tuesday it would start accepting in March applications for licenses to launch mutual funds devoted to investing in property projects.</p>
<p>It said earlier the new mutual funds, each worth at least 500 million baht, will help current government efforts to help revive Thailand's ailing property sector which has weathered a prolonged slump in the past four years.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-6520642</p>
</text>
